{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar v32 — brand-first home page meta description.

  Bing's SEO report flagged the description as too long: the previous copy ran
  ~180 characters, over Bing's 160 limit, and Google truncates at roughly the
  same point — so the closing clause never appeared in results. All four
  languages are now 142–155 characters, keeping the brand, the two product
  categories and the shipping offer, and dropping the returns clause (which is
  stated on the page itself and in the trust strip).

  A description set under Online Store → Preferences still overrides this.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bj_lang = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first | downcase
  case bj_lang
    when 'en'
      assign bj_desc = 'Official Besjaar store for showerheads, shower filters and refills. Compare models and spray modes. Free NL shipping from €25.'
    when 'de'
      assign bj_desc = 'Offizieller Besjaar Shop für Duschköpfe, Duschfilter und Ersatzfilter. Modelle und Strahlarten vergleichen. Versand in NL ab 25 € gratis.'
    when 'fr'
      assign bj_desc = 'Boutique officielle Besjaar : pommeaux, filtres de douche et recharges. Comparez les modèles et les jets. Livraison NL offerte dès 25 €.'
    else
      assign bj_desc = 'Officiële Besjaar webshop voor douchekoppen, douchefilters en navulsets. Vergelijk modellen en sproeistanden. Gratis verzending in NL vanaf €25.'
  endcase
  echo bj_desc
-%}
